3. VISUAL DIRECTION & EXTREME PERFORMANCE ENGINE (MANDATORY FROM LINE 1)

This app MUST feel instant, crisp, and buttery smooth even on mid-range laptops or tablets. Never ship heavy 4K PNGs or GPU-killing live blur layers.

3.1 Photographic Composition & Universal Scrim Rule

Every thematic image across the entire app (12 Hero Banners, 12 Sidebar Micro-Thumbnails, all Command Deck Bento Cards, and major sub-view feature cards) MUST follow one cohesive dark architectural studio aesthetic (Apple Pro / Dyson / Teenage Engineering / Leica mood):

Composition Lock: Primary visual subject positioned strictly in the right 40%–45% of the frame. The left 55% remains calm dark shadow for ultra-crisp text legibility.

Pre-Baked CSS Gradient Scrim (Zero Blur Cost): Every PhotographicCard overlays this exact pure-CSS scrim over the <img>:

background: linear-gradient(
  90deg,
  rgba(9, 12, 17, 0.96) 0%,
  rgba(9, 12, 17, 0.84) 44%,
  rgba(9, 12, 17, 0.36) 76%,
  rgba(9, 12, 17, 0.14) 100%
);


Zero-Flash Ambient Fallback: Every image slot in visualManifest.ts defines a bespoke radial/linear dark CSS gradient tinted with that module's signature accent color as the container's instant background, PLUS an onError graceful fallback so a broken network image NEVER produces an empty white box or ugly icon.

3.2 Strict Asset Weight & Loading Optimization

Strict Resolution & Weight Targets (visualManifest.ts):

Sidebar nav pill thumbnails: Max 320 x 96 px, WebP (q=68), target 4-9 KB.

Bento & sub-panel cards: Max 640 x 360 px, WebP (q=72), target 16-30 KB.

Page Hero banners: Max 1200 x 400 px, WebP (q=75), target 40-65 KB.

When using curated photographic URLs (e.g., Unsplash CDN) or generated assets, ALWAYS enforce strict sizing and WebP compression query params (?auto=format&fit=crop&w=640&q=72&fm=webp for cards, w=320&q=65&fm=webp for sidebar, w=1200&q=75&fm=webp for heroes) — NEVER load uncompressed original files.

Priority & Preloading Pipeline:

Active Hero Banner + top 4 Pinned Bento cards: loading="eager", fetchPriority="high", decoding="async".

Below-the-fold cards, sidebar thumbs, and sub-cards: loading="lazy", decoding="async".

On sidebar item hover (onMouseEnter), pre-warm that route's JS chunk and Hero image inside requestIdleCallback so clicking a tab feels instantaneous (0 ms lag).

GPU & Rendering Discipline:

ZERO backdrop-filter: blur() inside scrolling containers, Bento grids, or sidebar lists. Allow subtle blur strictly on floating modals (Cmd+K Command Palette).

Apply contain: layout paint style on every PhotographicCard and content-visibility: auto; contain-intrinsic-size: 240px; on below-the-fold cards.

Animate ONLY compositor properties (transform, opacity).

Wrap PhotographicCard, sidebar nav items, and SVG charts in React.memo.

Debounce live search inputs (120 ms) and batched localStorage writes (250 ms).

Apply font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums to ALL timers, biometrics, calories, macros, weights, and currency values so digits never jitter.

